<title>USA: Advanced NMR exploring strategic options.</title>
<headline>Advanced NMR exploring strategic options.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced NMR Systems Inc Chairman and Chief Executive Jack Nelson said Wednesday the company was exploring &quot;strategic alternatives&quot; to enhance shareholder value.</p>
<p>Nelson, who made his statement in the company's second quarter earnings release, did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available for further comment.</p>
